</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 240.525px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Genetic CM-TMA</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 303.342px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Anti-complement therapy</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 240.525px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>&#x000a0;Acquired CM-TMA</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 303.342px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Anti-complement therapy</p>
<p>Therapeutic plasma exchange</p>
<p>Immunosuppression</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 240.525px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>&#x000a0;TMA associated with secondary causes</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 303.342px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>&#x000a0;<bold>Treatment options</bold></p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 240.525px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Infection-associated</bold></p>
<p>Bacterial (<italic toggle="yes">Streptococcus pneumoniae</italic>, STEC)</p>
<p>Viral (ie, influenza, human immunodeficiency virus, dengue)</p>
<p>Protozoa (<italic toggle="yes">Toxoplasma gondii</italic>)</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 303.342px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Supportive management</p>
<p>Treatment of underlying infection</p>
<p>Antibiotic use in STEC is controversial</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 240.525px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Drug-induced</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 303.342px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Drug withdrawal (if possible)</p>
<p>Can consider therapeutic plasma exchange with immune-mediated TMA</p>
<p>Some case reports describe using anti-complement therapy</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 240.525px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Cobalmin deficiency-associated</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 303.342px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Vitamin B12 repletion</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 240.525px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Mutation-associated non-complement mediated </bold></p>
<p>DGKE-TMA, TSEN-TMA, INF-TMA, EXOSC3-TMA</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 303.342px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Supportive care</p>
<p>Limited benefits of anti-complement therapy</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 240.525px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Pregnancy-associated</bold></p>
</td>
